WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.961 --> 00:00:03.504
- Is this everyone?

00:00:03.504 --> 00:00:05.292
- Kaylan said he's going to be late.

00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:07.091
- Okay, well we'll start without him.

00:00:07.091 --> 00:00:10.136
I wanted to talk to you guys
about our toiletry campaigns.

00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:13.011
- Hey.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.183
Sorry, I don't want to interrupt the flow.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:19.353
- Well, you did. Meeting ruined.

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:21.313
(laughter)

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:24.955
- Yeah, someone didn't get the memo!

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:26.545
- Yeah, I don't even think we can be

00:00:26.545 --> 00:00:29.103
friends anymore, now, Kaylan.

00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:31.270
- Yeah, Kaylan, you're fired.

00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:38.163
(awkward laughter)

00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:46.130
- That's a good joke, Natalie.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:49.128
- Ah, nothing like a little
wholesome coworker ribbing.

00:00:49.128 --> 00:00:50.884
So back to the toiletry campaigns...

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.539
Kaylan, what are you doing?

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:55.180
- Sitting down?

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.794
- I just fired you.

00:00:58.309 --> 00:01:00.561
- You weren't serious?

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:02.410
- No, of course not.

00:01:02.882 --> 00:01:04.430
Good one, Natalie!

00:01:05.691 --> 00:01:07.381
Kaylan, sit down.

00:01:07.381 --> 00:01:08.569
Just 'cause I'm the boss now,

00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:09.987
doesn't mean we can't joke around

00:01:09.987 --> 00:01:12.007
like when I was the receptionist.

00:01:13.616 --> 00:01:14.784
- [Man on left] Hey,
can these go out today?

00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:16.535
- It's too late! You're fired!

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:18.413
More candy? Fired.

00:01:18.413 --> 00:01:19.621
- I've only got one package today.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:21.123
- That's it, fired.

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:22.083
- I don't even work here.

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:23.590
- Not anymore.

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:28.247
- So you are joking, right?

00:01:28.247 --> 00:01:30.007
- I, I think so.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:31.050
- You think so?

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.302
- Honestly, I just was
joking around to seem cool,

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:36.430
but now I've fallen down
a sort of rabbit hole

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.021
and I'm not really sure
how to get out of the joke.

00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:40.601
- Just stop.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:43.021
We get it, it's cool. You did it!

00:01:43.021 --> 00:01:45.731
- But, Kaylan, you
actually are on thin ice.

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:48.400
So maybe that's what
makes the joke so good.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.778
A sort of funny-because-it's-true
type thing.

00:01:50.778 --> 00:01:53.781
- It's not funny because
it's true though, right?

00:01:54.531 --> 00:01:58.723
Because it's not true,
it's just a joke, right?

00:02:00.491 --> 00:02:01.539
- What's funnier?

00:02:01.539 --> 00:02:02.706
- Neither.

00:02:03.041 --> 00:02:04.583
- Well, why does Kaylan's opinion matter,

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.502
because he doesn't work
here anymore, right?

00:02:07.002 --> 00:02:09.129
- Do not keep feeding this, Elliot.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.840
- Sorry.

00:02:11.215 --> 00:02:12.918
- You don't have to do this, Natalie.

00:02:13.908 --> 00:02:15.511
Just say, "Just kidding" and

00:02:15.511 --> 00:02:17.653
we'll all pretend this didn't happen.

00:02:17.653 --> 00:02:18.722
- Mm-hmm.
- [Voiceover] Mm-hmm.

00:02:18.722 --> 00:02:20.807
- But you guys would still
think I'm funny though, right?

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:21.683
- Yes.
- Of course.

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:22.769
- Absolutely!

00:02:22.769 --> 00:02:25.896
- But not too funny, like you
would still take me seriously.

00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:26.933
- Sure.
- Yes.

00:02:26.933 --> 00:02:28.440
- Sweet Christ, yes.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:29.691
- I'm so bored.

00:02:30.681 --> 00:02:32.444
- Gotcha!

00:02:32.904 --> 00:02:36.660
Kaylan, I was kidding,
sit down, we'll move on.

00:02:37.282 --> 00:02:40.869
Ah, that was fun, back to
the toiletry campaigns.

00:02:41.453 --> 00:02:43.540
I'm going to need all of
you to pick up the slack

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.791
now that Kaylan has been terminated.

00:02:50.383 --> 00:02:52.027
- Good one, Natalie.

00:02:53.715 --> 00:02:55.426
Pack your bags, Kaylan,

00:02:55.426 --> 00:02:58.220
and if you have a badge, I'd like it.

00:02:58.971 --> 00:03:01.890
(dramatic music)

